    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##AI in Creative Writing\r\n\r\nIn this level, you are the Pilot. You provide the heart and soul of your writing. The AI is your Co-Pilot, helping you navigate through \"writer's block\" and suggesting new paths for your imagination.\r\n\r\n#### How to start:\r\n\r\n* Give your Co-Pilot a mission: Type a prompt using different artifacts from your brainstorming.\r\n\t* Don't just say \"write a story.\" Instead, try prompts like: _\"I have a character named Leo who is a shy inventor. Can you suggest three ways to describe his workshop?\"_\r\n\r\n* Compare and Contrast: Ask the AI for two different versions of the same idea. Which one fits your vision better?\r\n\r\n* The \"Ownership\" Check: Look at the AI's suggestions. If you love a word it used, keep it! If it changed your character’s personality, reject it. Remember, you are the one who decides what stays in the story.\r\n",
